#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Some customers are best avoided. Although... Leaning into it can be... fun now and then, ehehe!"
msgstr "Manche Kunden meidet man am besten. Obwohl... sich darauf einzulassen kann... hin und wieder Spaß machen, ehehe!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Some dipshit thought it would be a great idea to ruin this room and now I have to clean it."
msgstr "Irgendein Vollidiot hielt es für eine tolle Idee, diesen Raum zu verwüsten, und jetzt muss ich ihn putzen."

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Some err... private stuff.</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Some err... private stuff."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Some people just suck.."
msgstr "Manche Leute sind einfach scheiße.."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "Someone like you deserves a little extra encouragement... Double the tip, if you simply... rest your hand on my thigh."
msgstr "Jemand wie du verdient ein bisschen extra Ermutigung... Doppeltes Trinkgeld, wenn du einfach... deine Hand auf meinen Oberschenkel legst."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Someone's noticed you talking on the phone, and you're talking to them first before talking to Zoey.A"
msgstr "Jemand hat bemerkt, dass du telefonierst, und du sprichst zuerst mit ihm, bevor du mit Zoey sprichst.A"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Something"
msgstr "Etwas"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "Something about obedient citizens like you... Drives me crazy, ehehe."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Something else? Well... I mean... sure, I can show you anything you like about them."
msgstr "Etwas anderes? Nun... ich meine... klar, ich kann dir alles darüber zeigen, was du willst."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Something happened, didn't it? When the crisis hit?"
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Something like that."
msgstr "So was in der Art."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Something like that. Hey, can I call you back later? Just a liiittle busy at the moment."
msgstr "So was in der Art. Hey, kann ich dich später zurückrufen? Bin gerade nur ein klitzekleines bisschen beschäftigt."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Something like that?"
msgstr "So was in der Art?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Something like that~"
msgstr "So was in der Art~"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Something that lets me sit on the couch at home."
msgstr "Etwas, womit ich zu Hause auf der Couch sitzen kann."

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Something that <b>your</b> kind of body would look incredible in, hehehe.
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Something that your kind of body would look incredible in, hehehe."
msgstr "Etwas, in dem dein Körpertyp unglaublich aussehen würde, hehehe."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Something's really fishy about this stand."
msgstr "An diesem Stand ist irgendwas faul."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sometimes I wish I could just instantly change hair colors. Would save a bunch on hair dye."
msgstr "Manchmal wünschte ich, ich könnte einfach sofort die Haarfarbe wechseln. Würde eine Menge Haarfärbemittel sparen."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Sometimes I'd just sit with her... close my eyes and listen to her purr."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Soo... He's not your flatmate?"
msgstr "Soo... Er ist nicht dein Mitbewohner?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Soon! I have some stuff to take care of first."
msgstr "Bald! Ich muss mich erst um ein paar Dinge kümmern."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Lio"
msgid "Sooo uh... What'd ya need me for?"
msgstr "Sooo, äh... Wofür brauchst du mich?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sooo... *hic* since we've been talkin' forever now and are basically best friends... like real close... *hic*. How' bout we just... *hic* fuck already."
msgstr "Sooo... *hicks* da wir jetzt schon ewig quatschen und praktisch beste Freunde sind... so richtig eng... *hicks*. Wie wär's, wenn wir einfach... *hicks* endlich ficken."

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Sooo... Is that a <i>no</i>?
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Sooo... Is that a no?"
msgstr "Sooo... Ist das ein Nein?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Soooo... this wasn"
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry I'm being such a burden to you, Sarah. I'm trying my best, I swear. It just seems like nothing is working out."
msgstr "Es tut mir leid, dass ich dir so eine Last bin, Sarah. Ich gebe mein Bestes, ich schwöre. Aber es scheint einfach nichts zu klappen."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry Zoey, gotta go. Landlady's on my ass again. Fucking Bitch."
msgstr "Sorry Zoey, muss los. Die Vermieterin sitzt mir schon wieder im Nacken. Fickende Schlampe."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry about that. Was the only spare dildo I had."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry for being a burden."
msgstr "Tut mir leid, dass ich eine Last bin."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry for staring. I think it's a really unique look!"
msgstr "Sorry fürs Starren. Ich finde, es ist ein wirklich einzigartiger Look!"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry for the inconvenience!"
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry for the trouble, Lio. How's the cleaning going?"
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry for the wait, sir. Here's your Neon Lime!"
msgstr "Entschuldige das Warten, mein Herr. Hier ist deine Neon Lime!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry won't cut it! You owe us!"
msgstr "Sorry reicht nicht! Du schuldest uns was!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry! Just haven't had much time to dig in. Plus I'm more of an apple girl anyways."
msgstr "Sorry! Ich hatte nur nicht viel Zeit, mich einzulesen. Außerdem stehe ich eh mehr auf Äpfel."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry! Sorry!"
msgstr "Sorry! Sorry!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean to."
msgstr "Sorry, ich wollte nicht."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I-.. I changed my mind.."
msgstr "Sorry, i-.. ich habe meine Meinung geändert.."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry, I-... I have to go."
msgstr "Sorry, i-... ich muss gehen."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I-... I know my arm looks weird."
msgstr "Sorry, i-... ich weiß, mein Arm sieht komisch aus."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, heh. Got another challenge for ya. We're looking for another high payout run. You think you can give us another big one?"
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Sorry, it's just... your... you know- It looks very... <color=#EB83FF>realistic</color>...
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, it's just... your... you know- It looks very... realistic..."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry, um... Maybe another time!"
msgstr "Sorry, ähm... Vielleicht ein andermal!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry-...! Didn't mean to pry."
msgstr "Sorry-...! Wollte nicht neugierig sein."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry. I'll get out of your hair."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry... I just... can't."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry... I-... I didn't mean to-..."
msgstr "Sorry... i-... ich wollte nicht-..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Mira"
msgid "Sorry...! I-... I didn't-... I don't-... Ahhh...!"
msgstr "Sorry...! i-... ich habe nicht-... ich tue nicht-... Ahhh...!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry? Hahaha. It just makes me want you in my lap that much more."
msgstr "Sorry? Hahaha. Das lässt mich dich nur noch mehr auf meinem Schoß wollen."

