#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait! I must know! What did you say?"
msgstr "Warte! Ich muss es wissen! Was hast du gesagt?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait! Let me think. Hmmm... I must capitalize on this fortunate turn of events! But how...?"
msgstr "Warte! Lass mich nachdenken. Hmmm... Ich muss diese glückliche Wendung ausnutzen! Aber wie...?"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait! So you finally have some free time?! Oh my gosh, we HAVE to have a girl's day out!"
msgstr "Warte! Du hast endlich mal frei?! Oh mein Gott, wir MÜSSEN einen Mädels-Tag machen!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Wait, no! Not work like-... I mean it's just-... like a gig...!"
msgstr "Warte, nein! Nicht Arbeit wie-... ich meine, es ist nur-... wie ein Gig...!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Wait, really? Oh wow! I was kinda joking, heh. Thank you!"
msgstr "Warte, wirklich? Oh wow! Das war nur ein Scherz, heh. Danke!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Wait, what? Are you going to be okay?!"
msgstr "Warte, was? Wird es dir gut gehen?!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait, you fingered her? I'd pay to see that."
msgstr ""

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait- I didn't mean it like that!"
msgstr "Warte- so habe ich das nicht gemeint!"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait- That was you two? Wow. You saved my synthetic bacon with that. Those two enforcers seemed like they were looking for trouble."
msgstr "Warte- das wart ihr zwei? Wow. Ihr habt mir damit meinen synthetischen Arsch gerettet. Die zwei Vollstrecker sahen aus, als suchten sie Ärger."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait-... you want me to-"
msgstr "Warte-... du willst, dass ich-"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait. It like, stops the itch? For good?"
msgstr "Warte. Es stoppt sozusagen das Jucken? Für immer?"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Wait..! Am I hearing music? <b>You're</b> out having fun?! Tell me where!
